# Where the Vosk/Edge Impulse model files are served from. Leave unset for
# local dev (falls back to /models, i.e. web/public/models/ — gitignored,
# populate it yourself per README.md). For a deployed build, set this to a
# GitHub Release's asset base URL, e.g.:
# https://github.com/<user>/<repo>/releases/download/<tag>
VITE_MODELS_BASE_URL=
